proxy-bypass-list

Based on proxy-bypass-list by Sean Wright and its contributors:
https://github.com/SeanWrightSec/proxy-bypass-list

Independently maintained and extended by Axura:
https://github.com/4xura/proxy-bypass-list

Modifications in this distribution:
- bypass-list: expanded browser service coverage and removed loopback bypasses.
- foxyproxy-patterns.json: regenerated with the expanded hostname list and
  without loopback bypasses.
- README.md: revised setup, coverage, maintenance, and source documentation.
- Added FoxyProxy 8+ patterns, a JSON generator, and repository automation.

